  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education, Resilience and Access (ERA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education, Resilience and Access (ERA) is a multi-year education programme supporting equitable access to quality learning for refugee and vulnerable children in Jordan, while strengthening the national education system to deliver sustainable results at scale. Implemented through the Ministry of Education, ERA safeguards access to essential education services for the most at-risk learners and progressively shifts towards improved efficiency, learning quality, and system performance in line with national education reforms.</narrative>
  </description>
